00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:00.760
May sapat ka pa bang pera para sa Bagong Taon?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:01.760
Oo.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.240
Mag-pack up ng mga kailangan mong dalhin.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.280
Oh diba???

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:07.600
Tinanong ko ang ahensya tungkol dito.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.040
Ang bayan ng unibersidad na ito

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.440
medyo malayo sa school namin.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.400
Pero may tatlong bus tuwing umaga.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.520
Sa anim na tatlumpu, pito, at pitong tatlumpu.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:17.960
Dumiretso silang lahat sa Huayuan Supermarket malapit sa school namin.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.080
Libre silang lahat.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.360
Iniisip mo ang lahat.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.800
Parang hindi ka high school.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:28.000
Mas matanda ako sayo.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.520
Mas marami akong takeout kaysa kumain ka.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:33.920
Hindi mo alam kung kailan titigil.

00:13:34.320 --> 00:13:36.200
Walang ideya kung ano ang kalagayan ng batang ito ngayon.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:36.800
Ito???

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:37.960
Hanggang???

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:38.560
Hanggang Hanggang.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:39.800
Tita.

